# Environment files:
# - Root .env and apps/api/.env are runtime-only (ignored in build context so changing API env doesn't rebuild image)
# - apps/web/.env and apps/client/.env are kept so Vite and Next.js read them directly during build
/.env
apps/api/.env*
**/*.env.example
